{"type":"text","timestamp":1794321342533,"sessionID":"ses_e3a21d981ffebd45Va6soahg7t","part":{"id":"prt_1c5e2e01a001G3z5XNjB192ygl","messageID":"msg_1c5e2d08c001Vg5bazG3rUDV7b","sessionID":"ses_e3a21d981ffebd45Va6soahg7t","type":"text","text":"<think>All backend checks pass. Now the frontend.\n\nLet me update the todo and set up Tailwind.\n\nSteps:\n1. `npm install tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite` (dev deps) and `npm install react-router-dom`.\n2. vite.config.ts → add tailwindcss plugin.\n3. src/index.css → `@import \"tailwindcss\";` + sources.\n4. Write the React app.\n\nLet me do the npm install first.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794321342490,"end":1794321342510}}}
