{"type":"text","timestamp":1794321465534,"sessionID":"ses_e3a21d981ffebd45Va6soahg7t","part":{"id":"prt_1c5e4c0ab001429IniHhSRJbL5","messageID":"msg_1c5e49eb6001lAw6cf5olPWf4f","sessionID":"ses_e3a21d981ffebd45Va6soahg7t","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the shared form field components and the RecipeForm.\n\nLet me create a small `components/Field.tsx` with a labeled input wrapper that shows errors. Actually, let me create simple inline markup in the form to keep it readable but consistent.\n\nI'll create `components/TextField.tsx`:\n\n```tsx\ninterface TextFieldProps {\n  id: string;\n  label: string;\n  value: string;\n  onChange: (value: string) => void;\n  error?: string;\n  type?: string;\n  placeholder?: string;\n  hint?: string;\n  min?: number;\n}\n```\n\nAnd use it in the form.\n\nLet me write it.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794321465515,"end":1794321465530}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794321465560,"sessionID":"ses_e3a21d981ffebd45Va6soahg7t","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_VBCEwEghQa2aC6PTzeDwoY5N","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"interface TextFieldProps {\n  id: string;\n  label: string;\n  value: string;\n  onChange: (value: string) => void;\n  error?: string;\n  type?: string;\n  placeholder?: string;\n  hint?: string;\n  min?: number;\n  inputClassName?: string;\n}\n\nexport default function TextField({\n  id,\n  label,\n  value,\n  onChange,\n  error,\n  type = \"text\",\n  placeholder,\n  hint,\n  min,\n  inputClassName = \"\",\n}: TextFieldProps) {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n      <label htmlFor={id} className=\"text-sm font-medium text-stone-700\">\n        {label}\n      </label>\n      <input\n        id={id}\n        name={id}\n        type={type}\n        min={min}\n        value={value}\n        placeholder={placeholder}\n        aria-invalid={error ? true : undefined}\n        aria-describedby={error ? `${id}-error` : undefined}\n        onChange={(event) => onChange(event.target.value)}\n        className={`rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-sm text-stone-900 outline-none transition placeholder:text-stone-400 focus:border-amber-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-200 ${\n          error ? \"border-red-400 bg-red-50\" : \"border-stone-300 bg-white\"\n        } ${inputClassName}`}\n      />\n      {hint && !error ? <p className=\"text-xs text-stone-500\">{hint}</p> : null}\n      {error ? (\n        <p id={`${id}-error`} className=\"text-xs font-medium text-red-600\">\n          {error}\n        </p>\n      ) : null}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/TextField.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/TextField.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/TextField.tsx","time":{"start":1794321465525,"end":1794321465537}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c5e4c0ae001goaw66HVcWv1V5","sessionID":"ses_e3a21d981ffebd45Va6soahg7t","messageID":"msg_1c5e49eb6001lAw6cf5olPWf4f"}}
